flowchart TD
    JiraStatus["Jira status change"] -->|wakes| PRAuthor["PR Author"]
    PRAuthor -->|starts| Session["Session in the audit-platform environment"]
    Session -->|reads| Inputs["ticket + local specification + repository context + Files/Skills"]
    Session -->|opens| Branch["branch + PR"]
    Branch -->|routes| RiskAnalyzer["PR Risk Analyzer"]
    RiskAnalyzer --> Review["Deep Review / Pair Reviewer / manual control"]
    Review -->|saves| Artifacts["Artifacts: PR + branch + link to the task"]
    Artifacts -->|distillation| Knowledge["reusable knowledge about the repository"]
